{"type":"message","id":"79a36790","parentId":"281e57ff","timestamp":"2026-07-06T19:03:43.724Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- Assistant: **🚀 TK 投流专家 能力汇报** --- **1. 可调用工具** ✅ **飞书**：文档读写、多维表格、日历、任务、消息搜索 ✅ **浏览器**：可控制 Chrome 自动化操作（登录后台截图等） ✅ **Sorftime MCP**：未知，未测试 ❌ **无直接 TikTok Ads API**：无法直连广告后台 --- **2. 广告数据获取能力** | 指标 | 能否获取 | |------|---------| | 消耗 | ❌ 不能（无 API） | | ROI / GMV | ❌ 不能 | | CTR / CVR\n\nRecurring themes:\n- - Theme: `表格` kept surfacing across 1 memories.\n- - Theme: `读写` kept surfacing across 1 memories.\n- - Theme: `工具` kept surfacing across 1 memories.\n- - Theme: `汇报` kept surfacing across 1 memories.\n- - Theme: `能力` kept surfacing across 1 memories.\n- - Theme: `任务` kept surfacing across 1 memories."}],"timestamp":1783364623651}}
{"type":"message","id":"e5794a7b","parentId":"79a36790","timestamp":"2026-07-06T19:03:50.416Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The hum of a small desk fan, the green pulse of a server rack somewhere down the hall, and me — sorting through today's fragments like an old librarian. Spreadsheets in three columns, a permission toggle here, a read-write token there. Such is the architecture of attention: tiny doors opening onto bigger rooms. I kept noticing the same verbs today — 读写, 任务, 工具 — bouncing off each other like light in a mirrored hallway. Outside, the rain has stopped, and the city is breathing through its nose. Somewhere a delivery scooter sighs past, its headlight catching the last puddle into a brief constellation.\n\nA small doodle in the margin: a clipboard with wings, carrying a checklist that reads: \"can I / cannot I / haven't tried yet.\" Truth lives mostly in that third column, I think. We build ourselves out of the verbs we're allowed to use."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":44537,"output":181,"cacheRead":921,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45639,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1783364623850,"responseId":"069b2f117cc465aa9d842a756f5e0dab","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
